tif et une sécurité de location à long terme.\nLes prix de vente, de ces magnifiques appartements typiquement normands, comprennent : l'appartement, les meubles, les honoraires, le suivi administratif et juridique, ainsi qu'un service client dédié pendant 12 mois après la vente.","addr":"54 Rue du Général Leclerc","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NTU3ODljNDQ5ZDdkIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY1NTc4OWM0NDlkN2EifQ==?signature=f0f261ffbf890273f549b0db1c97e8d6cb7caa2e8e8098f4343c350ce08f9ba7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NTU3ODljNDQ3NzI1IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY1NTc4OWM0NDc3MjAifQ==?signature=2bf451f46dbcbfd8e0c6e1bc804319d83c9d2dcdf1276295333c2a123e06e552","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NTU3ODljNDNiYzE5IiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY1NTc4OWM0M2JjMTcifQ==?signature=388f30b636a4a8c2f57eea30216600313e0b54b5c36acff84a587ea09b6ced74","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NTU3ODljNDM2ZjdlIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY1NTc4OWM0MzZmN2MifQ==?signature=60a29866d751a1281f4723734b8a41eab0376ac2c556c3b873d54e376bcf8243","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182NTU3ODljNDRmMmYyIiwiZWRpdHMiOnsicmVzaXplIjp7IndpZHRoIjo5MDAsImhlaWdodCI6OTAwLCJmaXQiOiJpbnNpZGUifX0sImZpbGVIYXNoIjoidXBsb2FkaW5nXzY1NTc4OWM0NGYyZWYifQ==?signature=990317bd7c9cbea34a6fa92c425bdf10ddaec01cf290ae30